  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Contribution procedures",
      "source_hash": 17786040110340956269,
      "context_hash": 5346779741671620232,
      "translation": "기여 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661998Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Bug reports",
      "source_hash": 11573760882833755797,
      "context_hash": 1641220366122021188,
      "translation": "버그 보고",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661998Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "While bugs are unfortunate, they're a reality in software.",
      "source_hash": 13691641813425496246,
      "context_hash": 12625179910287686682,
      "translation": "버그는 달갑지 않지만, 소프트웨어에서 피할 수 없는 현실입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "We can't fix what we don't know about, so please report liberally.",
      "source_hash": 10006914356534217638,
      "context_hash": 16758664857362839522,
      "translation": "저희가 모르는 문제는 고칠 수 없으므로, 부담 없이 적극적으로 보고해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "If you're not sure if something is a bug, feel free to open an issue anyway.",
      "source_hash": 9379842817579133550,
      "context_hash": 11359151709072075135,
      "translation": "어떤 것이 버그인지 확실하지 않더라도 주저하지 말고 이슈를 열어 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**If you believe reporting your bug publicly represents a security risk to Rust users, please follow our [instructions for reporting security vulnerabilities][vuln]**.",
      "source_hash": 3760479086649848498,
      "context_hash": 9177643358315464419,
      "translation": "**버그를 공개적으로 보고하는 것이 Rust 사용자에게 보안 위험이 된다고 판단되면, [보안 취약점 보고 지침][vuln]을 따라 주십시오**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "If you're using the nightly channel, please check if the bug exists in the latest toolchain before filing your bug.",
      "source_hash": 11867884943314824377,
      "context_hash": 11004699010451866060,
      "translation": "nightly 채널을 사용하고 있다면, 버그를 제출하기 전에 최신 툴체인에서도 해당 버그가 발생하는지 확인해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "It might be fixed already.",
      "source_hash": 14062702397958504612,
      "context_hash": 17752165597801425270,
      "translation": "이미 수정되었을 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "If you have the chance, before reporting a bug, please [search existing issues], as it's possible that someone else has already reported your error.",
      "source_hash": 4352631934591162211,
      "context_hash": 6601422205813225412,
      "translation": "다른 사람이 같은 오류를 이미 보고했을 수도 있으므로, 여유가 있다면 버그를 보고하기 전에 [기존 이슈를 검색][search existing issues]해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This doesn't always work, and sometimes it's hard to know what to search for, so consider this extra credit.",
      "source_hash": 10029043604408017016,
      "context_hash": 16561656716239312903,
      "translation": "검색이 항상 효과가 있는 것은 아니고 무엇을 검색해야 할지 알기 어려울 때도 있으므로, 이는 필수가 아닌 추가 노력으로 여기십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "We won't mind if you accidentally file a duplicate report.",
      "source_hash": 17166559156931283944,
      "context_hash": 7167097190553650543,
      "translation": "실수로 중복 보고를 제출하더라도 괜찮습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Similarly, to help others who encountered the bug find your issue, consider filing an issue with a descriptive title, which contains information that might be unique to it.",
      "source_hash": 8167341003916073405,
      "context_hash": 10175249986150390107,
      "translation": "마찬가지로, 같은 버그를 겪은 다른 사람들이 여러분의 이슈를 찾을 수 있도록, 해당 버그에만 해당할 수 있는 정보를 담은 설명적인 제목으로 이슈를 제출하는 것을 고려해 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.661999Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "This can be the language or compiler feature used, the conditions that trigger the bug, or part of the error message if there is any.",
      "source_hash": 4286906302329967417,
      "context_hash": 1163893860693708640,
      "translation": "사용한 언어 기능이나 컴파일러 기능, 버그를 유발하는 조건, 또는 오류 메시지가 있다면 그 일부를 제목에 넣을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "An example could be: **\"impossible case reached\" on lifetime inference for impl Trait in return position**.",
      "source_hash": 16860511056046686397,
      "context_hash": 18315014390231602508,
      "translation": "예를 들면 다음과 같습니다: **반환 위치의 impl 트레이트에 대한 라이프타임 추론에서 \"impossible case reached\" 발생**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "trait": "트레이트",
        "lifetime": "라이프타임"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Opening an issue is as easy as following [this link][create an issue] and filling out the fields in the appropriate provided template.",
      "source_hash": 185999655595865821,
      "context_hash": 10703728995818936707,
      "translation": "이슈를 여는 방법은 간단합니다. [이 링크][create an issue]를 따라가서 제공된 템플릿 중 알맞은 것의 항목을 채우면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Other procedures",
      "source_hash": 4006235205513596076,
      "context_hash": 3695733953792441506,
      "translation": "기타 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Other contribution procedures are documented with the parts of the guide that own them:",
      "source_hash": 12305810985437846911,
      "context_hash": 14591801075368110510,
      "translation": "그 밖의 기여 절차는 가이드에서 해당 내용을 다루는 부분에 문서화되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "<a id=\"bug-fixes-or-normal-code-changes\"></a> <a id=\"pull-requests\"></a>",
      "source_hash": 7839402046983149168,
      "context_hash": 897111533858857344,
      "translation": "<a id=\"bug-fixes-or-normal-code-changes\"></a> <a id=\"pull-requests\"></a>",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For routine changes or large, cross-cutting pull requests, see [normal code changes](getting-started.md#bug-fixes-or-normal-code-changes), [PR lifecycle](./pr-lifecycle.md), and [pull request guidance](getting-started.md#pull-requests).",
      "source_hash": 8842462837351497707,
      "context_hash": 17864819323399831815,
      "translation": "일상적인 변경이나 여러 영역에 걸친 대규모 풀 리퀘스트에 대해서는 [일반적인 코드 변경](getting-started.md#bug-fixes-or-normal-code-changes), [PR 생명주기](./pr-lifecycle.md), [풀 리퀘스트 안내](getting-started.md#pull-requests)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "<a id=\"new-features\"></a> <a id=\"breaking-changes\"></a> <a id=\"major-changes\"></a>",
      "source_hash": 1298924413798346555,
      "context_hash": 6334782361854689968,
      "translation": "<a id=\"new-features\"></a> <a id=\"breaking-changes\"></a> <a id=\"major-changes\"></a>",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "For new features, major changes, and breaking changes, see [Implementing new language features](implementing-new-features.md) and [Procedures for breaking changes](bug-fix-procedure.md).",
      "source_hash": 960749457475740268,
      "context_hash": 7995430869826074206,
      "translation": "새 기능, 주요 변경, 호환성을 깨는 변경에 대해서는 [새 언어 기능 구현하기](implementing-new-features.md)와 [호환성을 깨는 변경 절차](bug-fix-procedure.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T10:01:41.662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
